2
00:00:03,421 --> 00:00:05,421
(Leonard:)Raj and Howard
are at Howard's moms,

3
00:00:05,589 --> 00:00:07,189
(Leonard:)but should we call the girls
and see if they want to come?

4
00:00:07,358 --> 00:00:09,668
(Penny:)-No. Bernadette's working late.
-Amy's sick.

5
00:00:09,827 --> 00:00:12,277
(Leonard:)-What's wrong with her?
-Well, she talks a lot.

6
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:14,170
(Sheldon:)She always wants to hold hands.

7
00:00:14,331 --> 00:00:16,001
(Leonard:)That's not what I meant.

8
00:00:16,167 --> 00:00:17,767
(Sheldon:)Well, if you were
referring to her illness,

9
00:00:17,935 --> 00:00:19,675
(Sheldon:)your question should have been,
"What ails her?"

10
00:00:21,572 --> 00:00:23,242
(Sheldon:)-What ails her?
-Oh. Who knows?

11
00:00:26,243 --> 00:00:29,743
(Penny:)Come on, anything can happen.
We can push him down the stairs!

12
00:00:31,949 --> 00:00:34,119
(Howard:)Hey. Thanks for coming to hang out.

13
00:00:34,285 --> 00:00:35,855
(Raj:)No problem. How's your mom feeling?

14
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:39,300
(Howard:)Okay, but she'd feel better
if she took her medicine.

15
00:00:39,457 --> 00:00:41,367
(Raj:)You know, when Cinnamon
won't take her medicine,

16
00:00:41,525 --> 00:00:43,095
(Raj:)I hide it in a piece of cheese.

17
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:45,240
(Howard:)Good idea.
We can wrap the pill in cheese,

18
00:00:45,396 --> 00:00:47,566
(Howard:)feed it to Cinnamon,
and then my mom can eat Cinnamon.

19
00:00:51,135 --> 00:00:53,915
(Howard:)-What do you feel like doing?
-I was thinking we could watch a DVD.

20
00:00:54,071 --> 00:00:57,641
(Howard:)Well, my mom doesn't have
a lot to choose from.

21
00:00:59,210 --> 00:01:02,020
(Howard:)Unless you want to watch
the video of her colonoscopy.

